            "review_title": "Review at Sushilab",
            "review_text": "Thao G\n3 contributions\n0\nBest sushi in Hanoi!!\nDec 2022 • Couples\nSo fresh and yummy!! The price is very affordable as well. We wanted to try a bit but ended up staying for hours to keep trying different types of sushi they offer. Couldn’t ask for a better quality!! Highly recommended and will be back to try the poke bowl!!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2022",
